      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED HOT QUALITY (2) is a promising dog yet to miss the frame after three starts including two wins and was in the minors again latest (25.66) over 457m at this track. Looks the testing material here. ROW BEAU (5) produced a blistering 25.23 winning over 457m at this track last start. Should be in this for a long way. CANYA KELSEY (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (19.72) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Leading player again. FEDERAL BLUE BOY (7) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
